# MCP itself has just expanded substantially too

The July 28, 2026 MCP release is another important frontier event.

The protocol moved to a stateless core and added/solidified an extensions framework, Tasks for long-running work, MCP Apps, stronger authorization and better HTTP routing/caching. ([Model Context Protocol Blog][4])

This matters for our ontology because MCP is no longer just:

```text
call tool → receive response
```

It increasingly includes:

```text
long-running tasks
interactive applications
enterprise authorization
distributed services
```

So new AgentWork surfaces appear.

