# MCP Apps adds another axis

MCP Apps lets tools return interactive UI directly into supporting agent clients, including dashboards, forms and multi-step interfaces. ([Model Context Protocol Blog][5])

So we're getting bidirectional convergence:

```text
WEB APP
   ↓
WebMCP
gives tools to agent
```

while:

```text
AGENT TOOL
   ↓
MCP Apps
gives UI to human
```

That's fascinating.

The boundary between:

```text
website
application
agent
tool
UI
```

is becoming much softer.

